			"text":"Stories/story telling",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":2040,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a31125fe7f361270",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Religion without Faith",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":2100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dc0cd58059e95cfc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Organisational",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1200,
			"y":1100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bb45b603d8ee9268",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Make Canvas for Trait notes overview",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1240,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a9b59c6aebf7bbe2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Make \"#currentTrait\" tag for doc?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1240,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9958755fb81f0f1f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Blocks",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2020,
			"y":1500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"957290679387b8f7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. note transfer\n2. note transfer / brief font exp",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2060,
			"y":1580,
			"width":480,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"743ebbb9c2b7f01e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Everything bad happens at once\n\nWar breaks out\nDomestic terrorism\nStreet fights\nPandemic\nNuclear war threat\nNuclear testing\nDoomsday prognosis\nNatural disaster",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1480,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"375afc4be3c45b52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"FAMILY MATTERS MOST  \n\nWhat if, in trying to save your family, you are the one who hurt them most?\u0003\u0003  \nLoving dad who would do anything to protect his tribe, except question what that means.  \n\n-Daryl",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1480,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"66baae61e0a2e7b2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The only truly bad ending is the characters not addressing any of the issues between them but sticking together out of a feeling of obligation, being miserable.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1200,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"9666f2eb39f89177",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"POTENTIAL ISN’T ENOUGH \n\nHow do you love a child you blame for the life you never wanted-pushed to live your dream, and resented for succeeding?  \n\nChild prodigy turned housewife.  \n\n-Mary-Ann",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1760,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"d5eb7fc73df1e968",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"I WON’T END LIKE HER\n\nWhat does the end of the world mean to an artist who spent her life creating for social recognition?\u0003\n\nSkilled artist with nothing to say.\n\n-April",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2040,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"8662a864d6608b89",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Choices",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2220,
			"y":-1560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"756a73bdb5ee6c68",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Give money to charity?\nHelp out brother?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":-1480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"68922570cf4354a6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"BEING YOURSELF IS DANGEROUS\n\nHow do you choose between who people need you to be with who you are. Especially if you don’t seem to be good at being yourself?\u0003\n\nGifted mechanic, terrible artist. Trans - but can’t express it - yet.\n\n-June",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"d022ab948cad31e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Story",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1160,
			"y":-2040,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6f4f160bdc77818c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"When a system reaches a certain complexity it becomes nigh unpredictable both in what it does and in how it’s understood.\n\nBut There is a quality in that. But to try and control it..?\n\nYou can intentionally let go. Is what happened after intentional?\n\nWhen did you become so pensive?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"07b591c37afb8183",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The only character allowed to make erratic decisions is the player. Everyone else must be smart people doing smart things. Even if the player isn’t.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-120,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"c53473d89735cedc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tassen fallen, keine Tassen!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cf85202b2046c499",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Artist is something others should call you",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"54f7274267834571",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"cat approach:\ndont preach, instead\nBut wants to send a message\n\nHere’s me sharing what I think is beautiful",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":200,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"5bf9b4fa24faeb52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Add full books/texts of public domain works (+export func)(+april/mary-ann annotations)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":240,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"b886e9c40f1dbeb6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Misc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2420,
			"y":-760,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c499424705d4ca1d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Apocalypse did happen.\n\nPeople turn up with things to trade.\n\nShoot them immediately?\n\nSets off sequence of events where the mostly peaceful group grows resentful towards Daryl and decides to steer clear. No trade, no exchange. Further isolation. Eventually a well armed group turns up. They, too wish to trade.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"0ad6ce3690133914",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"How would even god know to find me?\n\nMany Aprils buried.\n\nUnderground\n\n  \n\nMakes me wish for\n\nNo more gilded Cage\n\nTurned to stone\n\n  \n\nGrave mistake\n\nNo Achieving heaven unless buried",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"42a156dbe163a309",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"only way to heaven is undergroud",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2d6fcfd594dcc94c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Everyone distrustful, selfish and rich/powerful enough to hide in bunkers and facilities left the world to those who weren’t. A utopia is born.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":-280,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"3af7d376ab7e2b7c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Cat:\nFamily themes resonate strongly\n\nConflict between mother and father very relatable\n\nSibling bond between April and June\n\nSees her as idol, frustration she can’t be the same\n\nCharacters have their own lives -> wants to feel that for them",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2820,
			"y":-400,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"b67a36c586832106",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Feedback",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2860,
			"y":-480,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1bfd68173ee78d49",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Suicide in Heaven**\nApril song title",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"25cddac6d1178238",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Only certain people get to heaven\n\nOnly certain people will survive",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":2120,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"49eece8d2a4ec55e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Because its the thing that gives things mass \nit has a lot of gravitas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":-580,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"cb33a2293b92bfd7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Pitch a game to someone and get some money\n\n  \n\nGet on the phone,\nTake out a loan,\nNow my money is gone\nAnd im all alone\n?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":-460,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"8c3b81015d67e4c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"We should start not dying early",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":-220,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"628d7bbfa29099e2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Keep it simple \nMajor developments on specific days",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1240,
			"y":1340,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"9d08b8d29ac05199",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**I see your reason, but remain blind to the truth.**\n\nOption: I’m sorry\nOption: ..you feel that way (skill check against)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1820,
			"y":-140,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"07d257d18e1db964",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The kids making breakfast",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":-1400,
			"width":260,
