		},
		{
			"id":"168d1a3a60604fd2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Rand objectivism**\nAyn Rand\n\nRational Animal\nEthics are self defense?\nMorality function is to ensure long term survival\nTrichotomy- intrinsic (Kant, thing itself)/subjective/objective\nReality is an objective absolute\n(Acts don’t care about your feelings)\nIf thinking rationally enough, everyone agrees\nTruly rational being would not use people as means to an end\nWould not self sacrifice\n\nNeed laissez faire capitalism!\nPursuing own rational self interest\nEssentialism/",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":2260,
			"width":540,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"2d7fb005718171e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Argument against existence and god**\nSimulation theory\nBest of all worlds\nLand as its own map",
