			"x":520,
			"y":820,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a0b1cc0c37b0c734",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Divide skills into classic male/female virtues?**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bc638ccf16f58510",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The Daryl Axis\nthe way traits are expressed and what they mean is not absolute but defined by how Daryl understands them.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":100,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"8a195788fb8424d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Make npc call out Daryl being a sissy if female virtues?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e7378c42dc6a337a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Project Sundial**\na theoretical 1950s top-secret Cold War concept for a doomsday nuclear weapon.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2100,
			"y":360,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"edad5c689bdedaca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A game about being trapped by your own perspective / self",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":2620,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"018904f518d99a46",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The author is dead and we killed him**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":2680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d8d95f9db9251e82",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**June, make a man of you**\nCasual racism casual bigotry \n[](https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7)  \n[https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7](https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1540,
			"y":-660,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"4fdb446cecf1b3b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Use focus to emphasise \n-> perception\n\n(Hovering a perception check option, the camera autofocuses on whatever the trigger is if its in the scene)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-40,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"60ff1ff8b651a58c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Meltdown: flicks of radiation on the screen, a humm, eerie blue light",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":180,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"89387d080cf73b4e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Different time**\nSame god",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1540,
			"y":-500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e1fcf62eb3b704aa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Burning books to keep warm",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":-1000,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2ce27da4a77388ad",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"-???-\n**Different time**\nSame god\nBurning books to keep warm\nMaintains the bunker\nGenerator give out\nDeep \nDrilling\nForgot\n\nTrapped in the abstract\n(Long term)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1540,
			"y":-420,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
