		},
		{
			"id":"4b0a556333dce21c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**June, make a man of you**\nCasual racism casual bigotry \n[](https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7)  \n[https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7](https://youtu.be/_GnJijhQkpk?si=ipFV5dUWuDysqPh7)",
