			"y":1120,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"7d22b9531f7ac123",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Apocalypse-ready and proud: The Douglas family from Colorado is stocking up for the end of the world. To stage this photograph, it took 15 people over six hours to move all of his stockpile - mostly kept in his basement - out onto his front lawn",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":1280,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{"id":"f64e1f0406ca064e","type":"file","file":"Img/DouglasFamilyLaidOut.jpg","x":180,"y":1560,"width":260,"height":167},
		{
			"id":"4f6f2b4c62bafc35",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The game opens, with the end of days. \n(with the closing of the blast doors - neat! ^^)",
