			"y":700,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"25affef9d667c2b8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1160,
			"y":820,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9b9a4ef591a31b18",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"These also rename/reframe the skills and may even be necessary to recognize/identify the harmful skills.\n\nThey may also allow you to level a skill straight beyond the threshold without it morphing.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":460,
			"width":260,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"167c01667fbdd7e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Allowing players to loot ideas\n\nCould the second tension hook be understanding the self?\n\nOr is that just frustrating?\n\nTaking different perspectives and puzzling together the whole picture of how Daryl works, how to actually improve and be there for his family",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"2f49a30ea2737c93",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The player can learn much earlier that the world probably didn’t end, at which point it’s their character they need to build to make him admit it to himself and his family.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":-220,
			"width":260,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"3625931f07c9157c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Maybe resource management doesn’t need to be that big a factor? Look at how Twd s1 handled it. Many small actions have an impact on how characters see Lee. Might this be enough?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"41bf43e31734dff0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clear mechanics to manipulate \n\nBoth into going to the bunker, but also leaving it.\n\nThe second one is pointed out that Daryl still thinks he’s the he arbiter of what should be done. That his skill gives him the right to decide for others.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":-20,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"bc992fd41817927d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Emoengine\n\nCharacter expressions should remain consistent between dialogue blocks. Blocks can alter or add nuance. Certain emotional states don’t allow for certain dialogue. Test this!!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"2d2a38f7ae16807a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Perspectives",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2240,
			"y":-60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"975017a1babc54e1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Perspectives (thought cabinet)\nThe player can chose (or unlock through specific event outcomes) between perspectives, perhaps at massive skill changes as cost/benefit.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"dd14a6720965ca97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"example: \nforesight 49: check water supply for germs\n\nsuccess/failure: foresight++\n\n-> in this case the player would have to deal with paranoia until they got it all the way back down\n\nEven a good to very good reason would not be worth the extra hassle\n\nBut if the border were fuzzy or there was a chance the skill didn’t get increased, players might take that risk.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2580,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":460
		},
		{
			"id":"289d32be10014a7a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Daryl comes up with stories and fables and myths to explain things or to motivate the kids to do their chores",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":280,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"7a4eb9c0d463312c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Bonuses on skill checks for acting appropriately\n\n-> dominance? -> stand on above them, orate down\n\nIncentivize through interesting camera angles",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":300,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"12d3e577729b72b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"April has a wall full of plants cascading down. However, keeping them alive requires constant power.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":420,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"d5fbfe9f1d6a5a6c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Add eLiza to the game, for Daryl to talk to?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":540,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9f02cfd04a74b260",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Remember / Forget Birthdays etc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1960,
			"y":560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"737f2b5de8c682b1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Possible perspectives:\n- Feminism (wave 1-4)\n- Gamer\n- Manosphere\n- Philosopher\n- Youth Pastor",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2280,
			"y":240,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"b66c391b24d71af6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Unlucky - things don’t often go your way. But failure suits you, charming in its of way.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":-300,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"926a55c9e3b185bd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Allergies - can’t eat everything, but hyper aware of ingredients, nutri stats etc",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":-180,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
