		},
		{
			"id":"c43572837bfa7024",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The talking pillow** \n->Breaking Bad",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":520,
			"y":1500,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3873d782d9722f7b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Ahhh.. wire (Jesse/walt) dynamic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":520,
			"y":1580,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4c73aab26acee150",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Are you going to work today?**\nSkylar, there’s rot",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":520,
			"y":1660,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"26202554670de3b3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Consider camp interactions\n\nTilly offers to talk, or play dominoes\n\nRandom encounters/conversafions between camp",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":580,
			"y":1060,
			"width":260,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"377b8e6d5db48c38",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Millerites now 7th day adventists**\n\n  \n\n  \n\nMormons - Latter Day Saints - 7th day of rest, coming end\n\n  \n\nMormons don’t believe in trinity, but the god head, multiple beings united by purpose\n\n  \n\nMonotry - accepting multiple gods existence but praying only to one\n\n  \n\nGod is people and there is a mother. People can become gods but not overtake the god.\n\n  \n\n[https://youtu.be/Pl8B55MqOQo?si=81EwkF-HdZx4fmMI](https://youtu.be/Pl8B55MqOQo?si=81EwkF-HdZx4fmMI)\n\n  \n\nPosthumous baptism\n\nBaptism through submersion (not just sprinkles)\n\nAt 8 years old (age of accountability)\n\n  \n\nHitler was reverse baptized\n\n  \n\nNowadays only close relatives \n\nTechnically not imposing the faith, rather giving you the option in the afterlife to chose it\n\n  \n\nThree kingdoms of heaven \n\nAnd the “outer darkness” (hell)\n\n  \n\nEncouraged to have a 72hr emergency preparedness kit\n\n  \n\n  \n\nIwabo\n\n  \n\n  \n\nLDS =/= Mormon\n\nreformed LDS (no polygamy, no head but trinity, no exaltation to godhood) renamed to community of Christ in 2001\n\n  \n\nJoseph Smith killed while campaigning for President\n\nSplinter groups\n\nson makes rlds, second largest Mormon group\n\nLDS don’t like other groups, try to equate Mormon and LDS\n\n  \n\n  \n\nBoy Scouts and Mormons high overlap/run by them?\n\nNot run by, but made Programm mandatory\n\n8-cub scouts 10 Boy Scouts\n\nThus, high influence",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":2080,
			"width":460,
			"height":1220
		},
		{
			"id":"a9417c44807024cd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Wir müssen lernen falsch liegen zu können**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":3160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
