			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"19d36f761476c4a9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" **exploration:**\n\n  \n\nTrying things and being awarded with little stories or parts as well as unique “thoughts” or traits (potentially one of two, similar to deus ex, only complicated further because you get the reward for saying certain things that you might not want to say but want the reward for)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
